This product bundles the following, each under its own licence.

The project-authored native-catalog-v1.cat, native-catalog-v2.cat and their -unsigned.cat
fixtures in crates/aa-windows/tests/data were generated with Windows SDK MakeCat
10.0.26100.0 and signed with SignTool using a temporary project-generated test key.
They and their native reference JSON are distributed under Apache-2.0. The catalogs
contain declarations for the existing hello.exe fixture and a project-authored text
payload, plus the public signer certificate in the signed cases. No private key,
PFX file, third-party payload or Windows certificate-store export is distributed.
tools/native-compare/windows-catalog-fixture.ps1 records how to regenerate them.

native-catalog-named-v1.cat and native-catalog-named-v2.cat are the same
project-authored fixture family with repeated CAT_NAMEVALUE member attributes
(File and OSAttr), generated using that script's -MemberAttributes switch.
They and the CryptCAT attribute reference snapshots are Apache-2.0 test data.
Only public certificates and declarations are included; no private key is bundled.

native-sip-hashes.ref.json is project-authored Apache-2.0 test data recording native
SHA-1/SHA-256 SIP results or errors for controlled byte layouts derived from the
existing hello.exe, hello-signed.exe and dotnet.exe project fixtures. The recipes in
tools/native-compare/windows-sip-fixtures.py and portable tests reproduce those layouts;
no additional binary, private key or host certificate-store data is distributed.

The project-authored native-inf-syntax.inf fixture in crates/aa-windows/tests/data and
its read-only SetupAPI reference snapshot are distributed under Apache-2.0. It declares
syntax examples only; no driver, installation or registry modification was performed.
native-inf-relationships.inf and its reference snapshot use the same project license.
They declare controlled device, service, source-file and registry relationships only;
no referenced driver or external INF is bundled, installed or executed.

The project-authored native.url and native.lnk fixtures in crates/aa-windows/tests/data are generated
with Windows WScript.Shell by tools/native-compare/windows-shortcut-fixture.ps1, without
opening the URL or running a target. They and their producer references are distributed under this project's
Apache-2.0 licence. They contain no third-party program or certificate.

